    Fix workflowInstanceId typo in capture agent guide (#8035)
    
    Fixes #7887.
    
    The guide told integrators to pass the event UID as `workfloeInstanceId`
    to /ingest/ingest. Since that endpoint accepts arbitrary form fields as
    workflow properties without validation, the misspelled parameter is
    silently ignored: the ingest succeeds but the scheduled event is never
    matched.
    
    ### AI Usage
    
    Claude Sonnet 5 was used to correct this spelling mistake.
    
